<section class="info-grid-section bg-light-grey">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="collection__title center" style="padding-top: 60px;">
      <h2 class="title" style="font-size: 28px;">How Pre-Order & Notify-Me looks on other pages</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"></rect></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Collection pages</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Our customers saw a 25% increase by adding this feature to their collection pages.</p>
        <a href="#" class="link" style="color: var(--color-brand-1); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">View sample →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Home Page</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">If you have products on the homepage, this feature helps you collect leads instead of losing them because of "Out of Stock" badges.</p>
        <a href="#" class="link" style="color: var(--color-brand-1); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">View sample →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Pre-Order Pages</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">By integrating this feature on your pre-order product pages, you let your customers the option to sign up for back-in-stock notifications.</p>
        <a href="#" class="link" style="color: var(--color-brand-1); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">View sample →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="collection__title center" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      <h2 class="title" style="font-size: 28px;">Channels to send notifications</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Email</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">The most popular channel of them all, with custom templates and automated sending.</p>
        <a href="#" class="link" style="color: var(--color-brand-1); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">View sample →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.79 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">SMS</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Send SMS messages to customers when their item is back in stock automatically.</p>
        <a href="#" class="link" style="color: var(--color-brand-1); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">View sample →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"></path><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Push notifications</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Push notifications are a powerful tool for back-in-stock alerts that help you engage customers and boost conversions.</p>
        <a href="#" class="link" style="color: var(--color-brand-1); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">View sample →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="main-features-section" style="padding: 80px 0;">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="collection__title center">
      <h2 class="title" style="font-size: 28px;">Main other features</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="info-grid">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Pre-order button</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Now it is easy again to offer pre-orders to your customers and let customers buy even before getting back in stock.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20h9"></path><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Widget style based on your shop</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Our app generates widgets based on your Shopify store's theme and look.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Advance reports</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Efficiently track all of your customer requests, review pending alert requests, and generate our major reporting data in a well-friendly system.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Premium Integrations</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Our app integrates with Klaviyo, Mailchimp, Omnisend and other powerful marketing platforms to enhance your experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Thank you message</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">To appreciate subscribers and engage them with your brand, send a "Thank you" message to them after they subscribe to one of your out-of-stock products.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg></div>
        <h3 class="info-card-title">Customized widgets</h3>
        <p class="info-card-text">Good news is we provide all the measurement tools and other customization.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-card" style="max-width: 400px; margin: 40px auto 0;">
      <div class="info-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></div>
      <h3 class="info-card-title">24/7 Online Support</h3>
      <p class="info-card-text">Our expert technical support team is available 24/7 to help you with any issues you may have.</p>
      <a href="#" class="button button--primary" style="margin-top: 20px;">Install App →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

